ds/thumb/9/95/Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png/233px-Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"233\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/95/Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png/350px-Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png 1.5x, https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/9/95/Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"360\" data-file-height=\"36\" /></div><div style=\"margin-left:27px;position:relative;\">崭新形象</div></div><div style=\"position:relative; margin-top:5px\"><div style=\"position:absolute; top:-2px; user-select:none; pointer-events:none;\"><img alt=\"Chatacterskinviewtextbg blue.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/95/Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png/233px-Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"233\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/95/Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png/350px-Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png 1.5x, https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/9/95/Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"360\" data-file-height=\"36\" /></div><div style=\"margin-left:27px;position:relative;\">崭新单品</div></div></div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:1em\">可用角色：</span><span class=\"item-link\" data-itemid=\"3016\"><span class=\"item-link-frame\"><span class=\"item-link-rare\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%A9%B4%E5%84%BF%E8%93%9D\" title=\"婴儿蓝\"><img alt=\"Bgequip5.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9b/Bgequip5.png/100px-Bgequip5.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit notpageimage\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9b/Bgequip5.png/150px-Bgequip5.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9b/Bgequip5.png/200px-Bgequip5.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a><span class=\"item-link-img\" style=\"width:60%; padding-top:7%;\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%A9%B4%E5%84%BF%E8%93%9D\" title=\"婴儿蓝\"><img alt=\"婴儿蓝\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-301601.png/100px-HeadIconSmall-301601.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/e/e2/HeadIconSmall-301601.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></a></span></span></span><span class=\"tooltips\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%A9%B4%E5%84%BF%E8%93%9D\" title=\"婴儿蓝\">婴儿蓝</a></span></span></div><div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:1em\">实装版本：</span>1.8</div></div><div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:3em\">来源：</span>点唱机</div></div><div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:1em\">所属系列：</span>构成理念</div></div><div><div class=\"grey-small test-hide hide-m\">编号ID：301603</div></div></div></div><h2><span id=\".E7.AA.97.E4.B8.AD.E4.BE.A7.E5.86.99_Garment_Display\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"窗中侧写_Garment_Display\">窗中侧写<small style=\"color: grey\"> <span style=\"display:inline-block\">Garment Display</span></small></span></h2><div class=\"infopad\">麻雀山少年宫中，有一个奇怪的孩子。<br />她总是穿着一身民族服饰，闭着眼睛，一副未醒的模样。她能够在任何令你意想不到的地方出现，譬如麻雀山的山顶上、晾衣服的挂绳上，甚至是少年宫最高的建筑上。时间久了，也没什么人在意这些事情，毕竟她是一个神秘学家，而神秘学家总有他们的理由。<br />孩子们学着和她相处，在她的衣襟上别上当季的鲜花。时间久了，他们称呼她为“睡朋友”，并时常邀请她参加夜晚的茶话会。在茶话会上，有手影比成的兔子、各色的茶点、头戴礼帽的访客，当然也有那位睡不醒的“爱丽丝”。</div><div id=\"崭新单品\"></div><h2><span id=\".E5.B4.AD.E6.96.B0.E5.8D.95.E5.93.81_All-new_Item\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"崭新单品_All-new_Item\">崭新单品<small style=\"color: grey\"> <span style=\"display:inline-block\">All-new Item</span></small></span></h2><div class=\"char-item-box0 tabber\"><div class=\"char-item-box1 tabber-item\" data-skinid=\"301603\"><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-301604.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/f/f0/Belonging-301604.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">印花头巾<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">Patterned Headscarf</div></div></div><div><img alt=\"利齿子儿\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/62/Value-2.png/27px-Value-2.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"利齿子儿\" width=\"27\" height=\"18\" style=\"vertical-align: text-bottom\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/6/62/Value-2.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"36\" data-file-height=\"24\" />0.8<hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>带有传统纹样印花的棉布头巾，柔软而整洁。她说，它能够收集阳光、湿润的豌豆和青草的气息。</div></div></div><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-301605.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/b/ba/Belonging-301605.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">小毡靴<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">Felt Boots</div></div></div><div><img alt=\"利齿子儿\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/62/Value-2.png/27px-Value-2.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"利齿子儿\" width=\"27\" height=\"18\" style=\"vertical-align: text-bottom\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/6/62/Value-2.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"36\" data-file-height=\"24\" />12<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"float: right;\">信任达到60%解锁</div><hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>粗羊毛制成的厚实靴子，既是漫长冬季的必需品，也是装饰精巧、富有民族特色的衣饰。“有了它，所有人都能快活地亲吻雪花与冰面啦～”受访者表现得相当兴奋。</div></div></div><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-301606.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/7/72/Belonging-301606.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">“温暖与甜蜜”<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">\"Warm &amp; Sweet\"</div></div></div><div>无估值<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"float: right;\">信任达到100%解锁</div><hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>沉甸甸的铜茶壶，搭配传统风味茶点。茶壶并非附属加热装置，但似乎在任何时候，它都能倒出热腾腾的茶水。“秘密是，糖块需要一个绿色的柔软拥抱。”对此，她小声地回应。</div></div></div></div></div><h2><span id=\".E8.A1.A3.E7.9D.80.E6.B5.B7.E6.8A.A5\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"衣着海报\">衣着海报</span></h2><div style=\"display:flex; gap:10px; border:1px solid #b55829; width:fit-content\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E4%BA%8E%E9%BA%BB%E9%9B%80%E5%B1%B1%E4%B8%8A1.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"衣着 于麻雀山上1.jpg\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/77/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E4%BA%8E%E9%BA%BB%E9%9B%80%E5%B1%B1%E4%B8%8A1.jpg/228px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E4%BA%8E%E9%BA%BB%E9%9B%80%E5%B1%B1%E4%B8%8A1.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"228\" height=\"325\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/77/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E4%BA%8E%E9%BA%BB%E9%9B%80%E5%B1%B1%E4%B8%8A1.jpg/342px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E4%BA%8E%E9%BA%BB%E9%9B%80%E5%B1%B1%E4%B8%8A1.jpg 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/77/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E4%BA%8E%E9%BA%BB%E9%9B%80%E5%B1%B1%E4%B8%8A1.jpg/456px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E4%BA%8E%E9%BA%BB%E9%9B%80%E5%B1%B1%E4%B8%8A1.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"1080\" data-file-height=\"1540\" /></a><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E4%BA%8E%E9%BA%BB%E9%9B%80%E5%B1%B1%E4%B8%8A2.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"衣着 于麻雀山上2.jpg\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/26/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E4%BA%8E%E9%BA%BB%E9%9B%80%E5%B1%B1%E4%B8%8A2.jpg/228px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E4%BA%8E%E9%BA%BB%E9%9B%80%E5%B1%B1%E4%B8%8A2.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"228\" height=\"325\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/26/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E4%BA%8E%E9%BA%BB%E9%9B%80%E5%B1%B1%E4%B8%8A2.jpg/342px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E4%BA%8E%E9%BA%BB%E9%9B%80%E5%B1%B1%E4%B8%8A2.jpg 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/26/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E4%BA%8E%E9%BA%BB%E9%9B%80%E5%B1%B1%E4%B8%8A2.jpg/456px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E4%BA%8E%E9%BA%BB%E9%9B%80%E5%B1%B1%E4%B8%8A2.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"1080\" data-file-height=\"1540\" /></a></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "衣着"}], "displaytitle": "<span style=\"display:inline-block\"><span style=\"display: flex;flex-direction: column;\">于麻雀山上 <small style=\"color: grey\">On the Sparrow Hills </small></span></span>"}}